      <figure>${s3}</figure>
      <div class="cap"><h3>You watch, then decide</h3><p>Watch the reel, leave feedback on any line, and approve it when it is right.</p></div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="sec source">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Every sentence has a source</h2>
    <p class="lede">Put the loupe on any line of the narration and it opens to what it rests on: the transcript entry and the diff. A line with nothing behind it is not narrated as fact.</p>
    <div class="src-grid">
      <div class="src-claim">
        <p class="time">0:27</p>
        <p class="line">The sender now ${ringSpan('retries 4 times', { seed: 21, sw: 3.6 })} and waits longer after each attempt.</p>
